# ENGLISH: Repo-wide Docker build-context excludes (Phase 6 - added for
# paymentx-control-center's own Docker support, but safe and correct
# for every existing service's Dockerfile too, since none of them ever
# reference target/, node_modules/, .git/, or log files from inside a
# build - only pom.xml/package.json and src/ are actually needed).
# Mirrors the exact same exclusion list already in the root
# .gitignore. Without this file, every `docker build` in this repo
# was silently sending the ENTIRE monorepo (every module's target/,
# paymentx-control-center/frontend/node_modules/, .git history) as
# build context - slow, and directly against this phase's "keep the
# distribution lightweight" requirement.
#
# HINGLISH: Repo-wide Docker build-context excludes (Phase 6 -
# paymentx-control-center ke apne Docker support ke liye add kiya
# gaya, lekin har existing service ke Dockerfile ke liye bhi safe aur
# correct hai, kyunki inme se koi bhi build ke andar se kabhi target/,
# node_modules/, .git/, ya log files reference nahi karta - sirf
# pom.xml/package.json aur src/ hi actually chahiye. Root .gitignore
# me already maujood usi exclusion list ko mirror karta hai. Is file
# ke bina, is repo ka har `docker build` silently poora monorepo
# (har module ka target/, paymentx-control-center/frontend/
# node_modules/, .git history) build context ke roop me bhej raha
# tha - slow, aur directly is phase ke "distribution lightweight
# rakho" requirement ke khilaaf.

**/target/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
.git/
**/*.log
logs/
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
.env
.env.local
